{"repositoryId":782078678,"availability":"available","full":"MarianoMolina/project_alice","name":"project_alice","description":"A framework for agentic workflow creation and deployment","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":255,"forks":33,"created":"2024-04-04T15:41:44Z","updated":"2025-01-22T21:20:23Z","license":"BSD-3-Clause","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":["agentic-framework","agentic-workflow","llm"],"demo":"https://marianomolina.me/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:44.923Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:44.923Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:44.923Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-15T18:03:44.923Z","stars":255,"forks":33}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Live preview - ProjectAlice @ my personal domain","Alice is an agentic workflow framework that integrates task execution and intelligent chat capabilities. It provides a flexible environment for creating, managing, and deploying AI agents for various purposes, leveraging a microservices architecture with MongoDB for data persistence.","What's new? v0.3 brings: - RAG: Support for RAG with the new Retrieval Task, which takes a prompt and a Data Cluster, and returns chunks with highest similarity. It can also be used to ensure a Data Cluster is fully embedded. - HITL: Human-in-the-loop mechanics to tasks -> Add a User Checkpoint to a task or a chat, and force a user interaction 'pause' whenever the chosen node is reached - COT: A basic Chain-of-thought implementation: [analysis] tags are parsed on the frontend, and added to the agent's system prompts allowing them think through requests more effectively - DOCUMENTS: Alice…"],"features":["Create and execute custom tasks using predefined classes or by creating new ones in the Workflow module","Define new parameters, prompts/templates, and agents for task deployment","Execute tasks with custom parameters, and visualize your prompts with the inputs parsed","Visualize the task logic in the flow viewer","Supported task types include:"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MarianoMolina/project_alice/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fbf027d8aaa5297bec3d7b41e463c007402c20fec73bcccf5159276af0270095","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.068Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.068Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live preview - ProjectAlice @ my personal domain","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MarianoMolina/project_alice/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"fbf027d8aaa5297bec3d7b41e463c007402c20fec73bcccf5159276af0270095","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MarianoMolina/project_alice/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.069Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-01-22T21:20:23Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/MarianoMolina/project_alice/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-15T18:03:45.070Z","hash":"fbf027d8aaa5297bec3d7b41e463c007402c20fec73bcccf5159276af0270095","originalBytes":26495,"storedBytes":26495,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["task","tasks","frontend","added","chat","node","user","workflow","img","new","agent","execute","agents","api","logic","now","public","shared","apis","data","google","search","them","create","file","llm","local","models","text","image","nodes","code","prompt","prompts","run","which","workflows","etc.","screenshots","studio","alice","allowing","any","available","execution","files","generation","information","inner","other","response","system","these","they","add","alpha","chats","context","deploy","don","embeddings","flow","model","module","set","start","support","test","update","uses","want","what","able","framework","knowledge","like","messages","need","speech","takes","types","using","arxiv","backend","being","check","container","database","done","exa","graph","how","input","inputs","jpg","keep","methods","output","produce","rag","reddit","single","their","tts","type","us